  "contentHtml": "<figure class=\"post-image tf_clearfix\">\n\t\t\t    \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/join-a-mushing-club\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"/images/attla/2012/03/Sled-Dog-Central.jpg\" class=\"wp-post-image wp-image-725 attla-content-img\" title=\"Dog Mushing Clubs\" alt=\"Dog Mushing Clubs\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t    \t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t    \t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t\n\t<div class=\"post-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<time datetime=\"2012-05-20\" class=\"post-date entry-date updated\">May 20, 2012</time>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"post-title entry-title\"><a href=\"/join-a-mushing-club\">Join a Mushing Club</a></h1>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"post-meta entry-meta\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"post-author\"><span class=\"author vcard\"><a class=\"url fn n\" href=\"/author/kathy\" rel=\"author\">kathy</a></span></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"post-category\"><a href=\"/category/highlight\" rel=\"category tag\">highlight</a>, <a href=\"/category/main\" rel=\"category tag\">main</a></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-content\">\n\n        \t\t\t\t<figure id=\"attachment_1726\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-1726\" class=\"wp-caption alignleft\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"><a href=\"/images/attla/2012/03/Picture-1.png\"><img class=\"size-thumbnail wp-image-1726  attla-content-img\" title=\"Picture 1\" src=\"/images/attla/2012/03/Picture-1.png\" alt=\"\"></a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-1726\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">1988.03-Fallgren, Lisa B. of George in ONAC</figcaption></figure>\n<p>If you are interested in sled dogs and want to join a dog mushing club<span id=\"more-722\"></span>, you’ll want to know about, whose mission and vision is to provide access to sled dog products and information for all levels of mushing experience, across the spectrum of mushing activities. To learn more about the <strong>No. 1 sled dog advertising and information source since 1997, go to </strong><strong><a href=\"http://www.sleddogcentral.com/about.htm\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.sleddogcentral.com/about.htm</a>.</strong></p>\n<p>The mission of most dog mushing clubs is to promote the sport of dog mushing, educate about the care, training and careful breeding of sled dogs, introduce newcomers to the sport of dog mushing, and support the dog mushing community. To learn more about clubs and organizations in the USA, go to <strong><a href=\"http://www.sleddogcentral.com/clubs_usa.htm\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.sleddogcentral.com/clubs_usa.htm</a></strong>.</p>\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<!--themify_builder_content-->\n<div id=\"themify_builder_content-722\" data-postid=\"722\" class=\"themify_builder_content themify_builder_content-722 themify_builder tf_clear\">\n    </div>\n<!--/themify_builder_content-->\n\n\t    \n\t</div><!-- /.entry-content -->\n\t\n\t</div>\n\t<!-- /.post-content -->"
